197	  /// Returns a list of devices specified by the user.
198	  ///
199	  /// * If the user specified '-d all', then return all connected devices which
200	  /// support the current project, except for fuchsia and web.
201	  ///
202	  /// * If the user specified a device id, then do nothing as the list is already
203	  /// filtered by [getDevices].
